- Lint: pass. `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, `git diff --check`, and workspace clippy with `-D warnings` all exited 0.
- TypeCheck: pass. Workspace `cargo check --locked --all-targets` and `npm --prefix desktop run typecheck` exited 0.
